a) Find the polar equation of the parabola $20x = y^2$ \text{[5marks]}

b) Find the Cartesian equation of the curve whose polar form is

$$
r = a(1 - \cos[2\theta]) \text{[5marks]}
$$

c) Find the Cartesian equation of the circle with polar equation

$$
r = 2a \cos \theta \text{[5marks]}
$$

d) Discuss and draw the graph of

$$
r = 1 + \cos \theta. \text{[5marks]}
$$

